{"id":722,"name":"rowlet","speciesId":722,"dex":722,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["grass","flying"],"stats":{"hp":68,"attack":55,"defense":55,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":50,"speed":42},"abilities":[{"name":"overgrow","hidden":false},{"name":"long-reach","hidden":true}],"height":3,"weight":15,"baseExp":64,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/722.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/722.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/722.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/722.ogg","genus":"Grass Quill Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"This wary Pokémon uses photosynthesis to store up energy during the day, while becoming active at night."},{"version":"moon","text":"Silently it glides, drawing near its targets. Before they even notice it, it begins to pelt them with vicious kicks."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It sends its feathers, which are as sharp as blades, flying in attack. Its legs are strong, so its kicks are also formidable."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It feels relaxed in tight, dark places and has been known to use its Trainer’s pocket or bag as a nest."},{"version":"sword","text":"At a distance, it launches its sharp feathers while flying about. If the enemy gets too close, Rowlet switches tactics and delivers vicious kicks."},{"version":"shield","text":"During the day, it builds up energy via photosynthesis. At night, it flies silently through the sky, on the prowl for prey."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Flies noiselessly on delicate wings. It has mastered the art of deftly launching dagger-sharp feathers from those same wings."}],"genderRate":1,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["flying"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"rowlet","speciesId":